&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Stackline is on a mission to fuel the future of commerce by bringing brands and customers closer together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About The Role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the Retail Operations Team, as a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Senior Manager, Brand Operations&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;where you will serve as the vital link between brand strategy and operational excellence. You will be responsible for managing the day-to-day and back-end mechanics that allow the world’s most innovative brands to thrive across multiple commerce channels. Utilize Stackline’s proprietary data set to uncover opportunities as a trusted advisor to some of the biggest brands in the world. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager, Brand Operations will be responsible for operating clients’ supply chains, enabling multi-channel fulfilment while driving profitability. You will own the results of brands’ performances and be the subject matter expert for packaging, fulfillment and supply chain optimization. You will be expected to be the subject matter expert and incorporate new supply chain and fulfillment technologies that optimize brands’ performances across retailers. This individual will innovate and be part of creating the tools and systems that will help brands successfully operate their businesses. &lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role based in London, UK (4 days/week in office).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Catalog Management – &lt;/strong&gt;create, maintain and optimize product listings to ensure accuracy, compliance and discoverability across all retail platforms.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Forecasting – &lt;/strong&gt;analyze historical data and market trends while leveraging proprietary Stackline tools to create accurate demand forecasts, ensuring optimal inventory levels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Order Management – &lt;/strong&gt;Oversee the end-to-end order generations, ensuring timely processing and coordination between brands, retailers and carriers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Channel Fulfillment – &lt;/strong&gt;manage and scale fulfillment strategies across various platforms to maximize logistical efficiencies and minimize cost.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promotional Planning – &lt;/strong&gt;partner with marketing teams to align operational readiness with promotional calendars, peak planning and new product launches.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defect Resolution – &lt;/strong&gt;proactively monitor and identify operations defects, including shipping errors, listing suppressions and supply chain disruptions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who We Are Looking For:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant supply chain and/or account management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years running and operation e-commerce retail fulfilment for programs such as Amazon Seller Central&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience using Microsoft Excel to analyze large amounts of data and draw insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience drawing insights from data to provide recommendations to clients on e-commerce strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to stay organized while prioritizing and managing workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of synthesizing various data inputs into cohesive, creative, and polished client deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated excellent written and oral communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus Points If You Have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience manipulating data with technologies such as Redshift, SQL, Python, or similar.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to develop new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits and Perks:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s important that each and every employee feels they are supported and can complete their life’s best work today and in the future. As part of that, we are committed to doing our part in addressing pay gaps and discrepancies by providing pay transparency for all of our roles. Actual salaries are just one component of the compensation package and may vary above or below the range based on job-related knowledge, skills, experience, geographical location, and performance. The pay range for this position located in London is £70,000 - £85,000 per year. Other rewards may include annual bonuses, short- and long-term incentives, and other team-specific awards. In addition, we provide a robust benefits and perks package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stackline is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does a AI Producer do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an AI Producer to support the delivery of innovative, technology-enabled content and campaigns across multiple channels and formats. This role is ideal for a producer with agency or production-house experience who is curious about emerging AI workflows and excited to help shape the future of creative production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Producer will manage projects end-to-end while collaborating with creative, strategy, production, motion, CGI, OOH, and technology teams to deliver high-quality work on time and on budget. The role requires a strong understanding of integrated production workflows, emerging AI tools, and the operational and legal considerations involved in modern content creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be highly organised, solutions-oriented, eager to learn, and passionate about production, technology, and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Areas of Responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key day-to-day contact for clients, agency partners, and internal stakeholders across projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support communication between creative, production, AI, CGI, motion, and post-production teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure project timelines, deliverables, and priorities are clearly communicated to all stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain awareness of client satisfaction and proactively escalate risks or concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help guide conversations around AI-enabled workflows and production efficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with interdisciplinary teams including creatives, strategists, technologists, editors, motion designers, CGI artists, and external vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster strong working relationships across local and global production teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and mentor junior team members where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a positive, collaborative, and solutions-focused production culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage medium- to large-scale integrated production projects from briefing through delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support productions across AI-led content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate schedules, budgets, approvals, assets, deliverables, and production workflows across multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evaluate and implement AI tools and workflows within production pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear documentation including timelines, trackers, meeting notes, status reports, and risk management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects are delivered on brief, on brand, on time, and on budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with project scoping, budgeting, estimates, and reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track project costs, vendor management, POs, billing, and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with production, finance, and operations teams to ensure commercial accuracy and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cost-effective production solutions while maintaining creative quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Awareness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a basic understanding of legal, compliance, and usage considerations related to AI-generated content and production workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support adherence to licensing, talent usage, rights management, and content governance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure production processes align with client, platform, and company compliance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate legal or compliance concerns to relevant teams when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-Day Responsibilities May Include&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and maintaining project scopes, timelines, and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating with WPP Production’s global production network to support integrated campaign launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing day-to-day communication with clients, agencies, suppliers, and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting productions involving AI-generated content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising with vendors and partners to obtain briefs, schedules, assets, and technical specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing trackers, reporting documents, and workflow systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting with production operations, resourcing, and traffic coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting safe innovation and experimentation with new production technologies and AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ years of production experience within an integrated agency, creative agency, production company, or studio environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across integrated content production including OOH, CGI, motion, film, digital, and social content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of AI tools, AI-assisted creative workflows, and emerging production technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of production and post-production processes from brief through final delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of asset management, formats, usage rights, and content delivery specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of legal and compliance considerations related to production and AI-generated content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and stakeholders in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, organisation, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to deliver projects on time and within budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural problem solver and passion for innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please contact &lt;a ----- ----- if you need the job advert or form in another format.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
