&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a results-driven UA leader to drive profitable growth for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Gram Games and Merge Dragons!&lt;/strong&gt;. This role will own the full UA strategy and execution across all major channels, leading scale initiatives while improving efficiency, measurement, and cross-functional collaboration.&amp;nbsp;You will work closely with Product, Creative, ASO, and Data teams to unlock sustainable growth, strengthen funnel performance, and continuously identify new opportunities. You will mentor and empower the UA team to deliver best-in-class execution with strong accountability on performance outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
