&lt;h2&gt;Alloy is where you belong!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alloy is the AI-powered identity and fraud prevention platform that accelerates onboarding, stops fraud, and scales compliance across the customer lifecycle so financial organizations can grow without limits. More than 900 of the world&#39;s leading financial institutions and fintechs trust Alloy for smarter risk management that drives growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through our values: Be Bold, Go Fast, Collaborate, and Celebrate Our Differences, we are creating a workplace where you can grow, thrive, and belong. See how we’ve been continuously recognized and named one of&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inc.com/profile/alloy_ny&quot;&gt; Inc. Magazine’s Best Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/companies/alloy/?list=americas-best-startup-employers&amp;amp;sh=55c076453c61&quot;&gt; Forbes America’s Best Startup Employers&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.americanbanker.com/list/best-places-to-work-in-fintech-2022&quot;&gt; Best Fintech to Work for by American Banker&lt;/a&gt;, year after year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out our investors and read more about us&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alloy.com/about&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alloy operates in a hybrid-work environment. We look to foster collaboration and community by having our local employees onsite twice a week, and remote employees onsite once a quarter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alloy expanded its operations globally in 2022 and has gained significant momentum in addressing fraud, risk, and compliance challenges for leading clients such as Monzo, WorldPay, and Santander. Our international focus is a key aspect of our mission to make the financial services industry more dynamic and accessible. To support this global strategy, we are enhancing our UK team based in London to serve the wider UK and EMEA regions better.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re delighted to be hiring, and our newest team member will be tasked with growing our business within our Strategic global accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The objectives will be to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Growth in Fintech and Banking: &lt;/strong&gt;Driving booking growth and market penetration, specifically in the fintech and banking sectors by achieving ambitious sales targets and securing large-scale enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Relationships with senior executives and technology partners: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop strong, long-lasting relationships with senior executives and key partners to understand their specific challenges and position Alloy as a strategic, high-value solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Alloy as an Industry Leader: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and implement strategies to establish our enterprise platform as the top solution for compliance and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify and Engage High-Potential Companies: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify high-potential companies and key stakeholder mapping to implement effective prospecting strategies to capture their interest in Alloy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate Strategically and Effectively: &lt;/strong&gt;Think strategically and demonstrate excellent interpersonal, communication, and writing skills to simplify complex contractual, technical, and financial details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director of UK/EMEA, Alloy is looking for an eager-to-learn, resourceful and results-focused player, preferably with 4+ years of quota-carrying SaaS platform sales. We require an entrepreneurial and driven account executive who can balance scrappiness with strategic thinking, take the lessons we have in the US, and translate them into the correct positioning and sales process for engaging and closing new clients in the UK &amp;amp; EMEA. Someone who will standout carries the following experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with a focus on client-specific needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft a compelling and differentiated value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a cross-functional hybrid environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify and prioritise high-value targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectiveness in building relationships with senior executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, logical, and actionable sales strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated understanding of account management strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build long-term, trusted relationships with key clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have excellent sales methodology acumen and can confidently demonstrate a professional approach to sales—preferably MEDDPICC.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in prospecting and consultative sales with strong discovery skills, empathy, and the ability to close business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative, efficiently coordinating with external partners and internal resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a strong and growing social brand&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, analytical, and ambitious with an entrepreneurial spirit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel within EU/EMEA as well as to America for team events and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a lean team, so your impact will be felt immediately, and opportunities will grow as the company scales up. If this all sounds like a good fit for you, why not join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alloy is committed to fair and equitable compensation practices. Pay may vary depending on job-related knowledge, in-demand skills, relevant experience, and/or geography. In addition to a competitive base salary, this position is also eligible for equity awards in the form of stock options (ISOs) as well as a competitive total benefits package. Your recruiter will be happy to walk you through the details and what compensation could look like for you specifically!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits and Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited holiday and flexible work policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension with employee contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 100% compensation for 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend for new employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual £900 learning &amp;amp; development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uncapped commissions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training programs to help foster growth (Alloy Foundations, Alloy Lead, Etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health and dental care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How to apply&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply right here! You&#39;ve found the application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alloy is proud to be an equal-opportunity workplace and employer. We’re committed to equal opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, gender, gender identity, parental or pregnancy status, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or veteran status. We are committed to an inclusive interview experience and provide reasonable accommodations to applicants with visible and invisible disabilities. We encourage applicants to share needed accommodations with their recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All Alloy jobs are listed on our careers page. Any communication during the recruitment process, including interview requests or job offers, will come directly from a recruiting team member with an &lt;a href=&quot;http://alloy.com/&quot;&gt;alloy.com&lt;/a&gt; email address. We do not use outside applications or automated text messaging in our recruiting process. We will not ask for any sensitive financial or identification information during the recruiting process. If you’re ever unsure, please contact us directly via our website before sharing personal information.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior Consultant with experience in Commerce ecosystems and technologies wanted to join our Business Services team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How consumers discover, evaluate and buy products is changing faster than most organisations can respond. AI-powered search, agentic commerce, generative product discovery and the collapse of the traditional funnel are reshaping commercial models across every sector. Most enterprise clients know something has shifted, few have a clear plan for what to do about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is building a commerce consulting practice to help clients navigate these shifts. We work with some of the world&#39;s most recognised brands, translating complex commercial challenges into actionable strategies, transformation roadmaps and delivery programmes. What makes this role different from a boutique or a SaaS provider is what sits around you: your consulting recommendations connect directly to creative, content, CX and commerce execution teams who bring them to life. Strategy doesn&#39;t end at a slide deck here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Consultant who can own projects and client relationships. Someone who takes an ambiguous brief, structures it independently, drives the strategic direction and ensures the quality of everything the team delivers. You&#39;ll lead client conversations, design and facilitate workshops, and be the person mid-to-senior client stakeholders trust to connect diagnostic findings to commercial action. You&#39;ll also play a key role in growing the practice, spotting extension opportunities within accounts, contributing to pitches and coaching more junior members of the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London/Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel to client site where required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Leadership &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own medium-scale projects end-to-end: scope, quality, delivery timeline, and client relationship. Accountable for the strategic direction and the standard of output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of strategic recommendations across commerce transformation, AI discoverability (GEO/AEO), agentic commerce readiness, content strategy and channel optimisation - shaping the narrative, not just building the analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ambiguous or loosely defined briefs and structure them into clear project plans with defined deliverables, milestones and resource requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and codify delivery methodologies into repeatable, scalable frameworks the wider team can execute against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and lead workshops, stakeholder interviews and co-creation sessions. You will be comfortable going off-script when the conversation requires it and steering senior client stakeholders toward actionable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to mid-to-senior client contacts. You are the person they call when they need the thinking sharpened or the direction challenged.&lt;br&gt;Anticipate and respond to client questions in a compelling and informed way. Own the client relationship day-to-day, identifying when senior escalation or support is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities within existing accounts - spot the extension, the adjacent brief, the unasked question and work with senior leadership to convert them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute meaningfully to proposals and pitch responses: shaping the strategic approach, writing key sections, and presenting to prospective clients where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build client relationships that generate repeat work - not just deliver well, but leave clients wanting more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop Consultants on the team: Setting the quality bar on projects, giving direct feedback, and creating opportunities for junior team members to stretch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may line-manage 1–2 team members, depending on team structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive practice IP development: reusable frameworks, case studies, proposition collateral and points of view that strengthen our market position and make selling easier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across WPP&#39;s integrated network: connecting upstream consulting recommendations to downstream execution in content, CX and commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive professional experience, with a strong track record in consulting, strategy or senior commercial/digital roles (ideally blending both)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how commerce ecosystems work: You&#39;ve either run a commerce operation (brand-side) or advised on one (agency/consulting-side). You understand how trading, content, category management, channel strategy and technology intersect in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AI discoverability: GEO, AEO, LLM-influenced discovery, AI assistants and conversational commerce. You can advise a Head of Digital or VP of eCommerce on what this shift means for their business and back it up with a credible action plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead projects independently - you&#39;ve managed scope, quality and client expectations without someone looking over your shoulder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic and analytical thinking: you can take a diagnostic output or a data-heavy assessment and turn it into a clear, commercially prioritised set of recommendations with a compelling narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and executive presence - you&#39;re comfortable leading a room, running a workshop, and navigating a difficult client conversation with credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building methodology or practice IP: You&#39;ve created frameworks, playbooks or delivery approaches that others have adopted and scaled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand-side experience in eCommerce, digital marketing or commercial leadership - you&#39;ve lived the reality of managing a P&amp;amp;L, running a digital operation, or leading a commerce team. This perspective is what separates a genuine consultant from a presenter of slides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in at least two of: CPG/FMCG, Consumer health, Automotive, Retail, Telecom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change management or enablement experience: you&#39;ve helped organisations adopt new operating models, not just designed them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line management or mentoring experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you know some of this, even better:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on curiosity with AI tools LLMs, agentic platforms, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with commerce technology (Shopify, SFCC, Commercetools, PIM/DAM systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to shape a growing consulting practice your work will define methodology and propositions, not just execute someone else&#39;s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct access to iconic enterprise clients and the opportunity to contribute to both proposition development and project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An integrated agency network where your consulting work connects to creative, content, CX and commerce teams who make the recommendations real.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team culture that values intellectual honesty, pace and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;London-based with flexible hybrid working and occasional client travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training, development, and a clear path to Senior Consultant and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
