&lt;p&gt;Strategic, visionary, and results-driven, the Account Director plays a pivotal role in leading senior client engagements, driving organic business growth, and delivering transformative healthcare communications. Acting as a trusted advisor to clients and an inspiring leader to cross-functional agency teams, this role drives overall account vision, creative excellence, team development, and financial profitability across every initiative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Senior Client Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate and maintain long-term client relationships built on deep trust, credibility, and strategic partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Strategic Account Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Strategy and Planning to transform client business objectives, scientific insights, and market dynamics into actionable communications strategies and tactics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Creative &amp;amp; Brief Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-develop and interrogate project briefs to ensure alignment with client objectives, regulations, and standards; partner actively with creative teams throughout development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage &amp;amp; Mentor Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, motivate, and develop direct reports (Account Managers and Account Executives), delegating tasks appropriately, setting priorities, and supporting their professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Financial Performance &amp;amp; Viability:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee overall account profitability, budgeting, resource utilization, and forecasting, ensuring agency profitability while delivering high-value work on time and on budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mine New Business:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify and seize organic growth opportunities within existing client accounts and contribute to agency new business pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pitch &amp;amp; Present Proposals:&lt;/strong&gt; Confidently present, sell, defend, and negotiate agency strategic proposals and creative work with senior client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Agency Supremacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate seamlessly across all agency disciplines at the right time and manage client vendor relationships to maintain agency leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
